--- Split into numbered blobs
data.1.tsv	300	300	599
data.2.tsv	300	600	899
data.3.tsv	100	900	999
data.tsv	300	0	299
1000	499500
--- The numbering continues from the number in the name of the first blob
data.5.tsv	300
data.6.tsv	300
data.7.tsv	300
data.8.tsv	100
--- All the split blobs are visible for the AzureBlobStorage engine table, and a truncating insert overwrites them and removes the leftovers
1000	499500	4
data.1.tsv	200	300	499
data.tsv	300	0	299
data.1.tsv	200
data.tsv	300
--- An exception if the name is already taken
BAD_ARGUMENTS
--- The taken names are skipped with azure_create_new_file_on_insert
data.1.tsv	1
data.2.tsv	300
data.3.tsv	300
data.4.tsv	100
data.tsv	300
